{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05452","headline":"奉和圣制荅张说扈从南出雀鼠谷 · 王光庭","name":"奉和圣制荅张说扈从南出雀鼠谷","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"省俗恩将遍，巡方路稍回。\n寒随汾谷尽，春逐晋郊来。\n云骑传行漏，烟旄引从台。\n惠风初应律，和气正调梅。\n雅颂通宸咏，天文接曙台。\n灞陵桃李色，应待日华开。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05452.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05452","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}